<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-INDIA 22-0 IN 1ST INNINGS V WEST INDIES (427) - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 22-0 IN 1ST INNINGS V WEST INDIES (427) - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON, Jamaica 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, replying to West Indies' first innings 427, were 22 for no wicket at tea on the second day of the first test at Sabina Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 427, India 22-0.</p>
</text>
